# .semgrepignore
# Excludes paths from Semgrep SAST scanning
# Without this file Semgrep scans node_modules producing thousands of false positives

node_modules/
dist/
build/
coverage/
.next/
.nuxt/
out/
**/__mocks__/**
**/__tests__/**
**/fixtures/**
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/*.test.js
**/*.test.jsx
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.spec.tsx
**/*.spec.js
**/*.spec.jsx
